          <p data-id="impact-msg-t" data-name="Text" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '1', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#666C73', fontSize: '15px', lineHeight: '1.6' }}>To set it up. You send your agent one message; it does the rest and asks you to approve a code.</p>
