          <p data-id="aff-2-1" data-name="Sticky" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '2', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2b2b2b', fontSize: '12px', lineHeight: '1.3', backgroundColor: '#FDE0D2', borderRadius: '4px', padding: '8px 9px 8px 9px', boxShadow: '0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.08)', transform: 'rotate(0.8deg)' }}>Don't pollute my agent's memory</p>
