  <div data-id="f1" data-name="Feature 1 · Typed cards" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '15', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: '100%', alignItems: 'center', padding: '72px 20px 0px 20px' }} id="f1">
    <div data-id="f1-in" data-name="Column" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '0', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', width: '100%', maxWidth: '600px', gap: '16px' }}>
      <p data-id="f1-k" data-name="Kicker" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '0', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#4358CD', fontSize: '14px', lineHeight: '1.4', fontWeight: '600', letterSpacing: '0.02em' }}>Feature 1/4</p>
      <h2 data-id="f1-h" data-name="Heading" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '1', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#4358CD', fontSize: '32px', lineHeight: '1.15', fontWeight: '700', letterSpacing: '-0.01em' }}>Typed cards</h2>
      <p data-id="f1-p" data-name="Body" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '2', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#2A2E33', fontSize: '18px', lineHeight: '1.6' }}>A find is not a message. A concert has a date, a venue, a price and a ticket link. A stock story has a ticker and a live price. Paste them into a chat and they all look the same.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
