      <p data-id="anatomy-cap" data-name="Caption" style={{ position: 'relative', flex: '0 0 auto', order: '1', fontFamily: 'Work Sans, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif', color: '#666C73', fontSize: '13px', lineHeight: '1.45', textAlign: 'center' }}>Anatomy of an event card. Every part maps to a field in the contract; the agent never sends layout.</p>
